  ],
  "description": "Operating Area: Naples, Italy, Palermo, Sicily, Olbia, Sardinia\n\nETHNA  is a Ferretti Custom line 97 launched in 2008, completely refitted between 2018 and 2020. Its size makes this yacht one of the 30 meters with the largest spaces on the market and with one of the best comfort on board.\n\nETHNA has 5 cabins with a total of 12 beds. The master cabin is on the main deck, with a large private bathroom, sofa and walk-in closet. On the lower deck there are two double cabins and two twin cabins with pullman beds, all with private bathrooms. The bright saloon has a large sofa and a big dining table. In the aft deck there is a relaxation area with sofa, convertible into a sunbathing area, and a large outdoor table. At the bow there is a large sunbathing area.\n\nThe flybridge is one of the highlights of ETHNA and has a sundeck area with Jacuzzi, sun loungers and a large table with folding hard-top. The access to the sea is particularly convenient, thanks to the staircase leading to the stern beach of about 16 square meters.\n\nETHNA's motorization allows it to cruise in total comfort at different speeds with high fuel savings, especially at low speeds (12kn with 150 litres/hour) and thanks to the 4 Mitsubishi gyroscopic stabilizers the yacht is particularly stable. The crew consists of 5 people: captain, chef, 2 stewardesses and deckhand.\n\nShe is equipped with Starlink high speed internet.",
